#: ../../source/file-formats/index.md:1
msgid "File formats"
msgstr "文件格式"

#: ../../source/file-formats/index.md:4
msgid ""
"Content below is migrated from the top-level `README.md`, `mcmc.cfg` (now "
"`config/cnet_mcmc.cfg`), and example output in `example/`. Please review for"
" accuracy — some sections flag open questions that need confirming against "
"the current code."
msgstr ""
"本页内容迁移自顶层 `README.md`、`mcmc.cfg`（现为 `config/cnet_mcmc.cfg`）和 `example/` "
"中的示例输出。请核对准确性；有些部分标出了尚待对照当前代码确认的问题。"

#: ../../source/file-formats/index.md:11
msgid "Copy-number input"
msgstr "拷贝数输入"

#: ../../source/file-formats/index.md:13
msgid ""
"A file containing integer absolute/relative copy numbers for all the patient"
" samples and/or the normal sample (*-cn.txt.gz or *-haplotype-cn.txt.gz)."
msgstr "一个文件，包含所有患者样本和/或正常样本的整数绝对/相对拷贝数（*-cn.txt.gz 或 *-haplotype-cn.txt.gz）。"

#: ../../source/file-formats/index.md:15
msgid ""
"Either compressed file or uncompressed file is fine. There need to be at "
"least four columns, separated by space, in this file: sample_ID, chr_ID, "
"site_ID, CN. Each column is an integer. Note that there should be __no "
"header names__ in this file."
msgstr "压缩或不压缩都可以。文件至少需要四列，用空格分隔：sample_ID、chr_ID、site_ID、CN，每列都是整数。注意文件中__不能有表头__。"

#: ../../source/file-formats/index.md:17
msgid "The sample_ID has to be __ordered from 1 to the number of patient samples__."
msgstr "sample_ID 必须__从 1 编号到患者样本数__。"

#: ../../source/file-formats/index.md:19
msgid ""
"The chr_ID and site_ID together determine a unique site along the genome of "
"a sample, ordering from 1 to the largest number (1, 2, 3, ...)."
msgstr "chr_ID 和 site_ID 共同确定样本基因组上唯一的一个 site，从 1 开始编号到最大值（1, 2, 3, ...）。"

#: ../../source/file-formats/index.md:21
msgid ""
"The site_ID can be __consecutive numbers__ from 1 to the total number of "
"sites along the genome, or __consecutive numbers__ from 1 to the total "
"number of sites along each chromosome of the genome."
msgstr ""
"site_ID 可以是全基因组范围内从 1 到 site 总数的__连续编号__，也可以是每条染色体内从 1 到该染色体 site "
"总数的__连续编号__。"

#: ../../source/file-formats/index.md:23
msgid ""
"For __haplotype-specific__ CN, there need to be at least five columns, with "
"the last two being cnA, cnB."
msgstr "对 __haplotype-specific__ 拷贝数，至少需要五列，最后两列是 cnA、cnB。"

#: ../../source/file-formats/index.md:25
msgid ""
"If the total CN is larger than the specified maximum CN allowed by the "
"program, the total CN will be automatically decreased to the maximum CN when"
" the input is total CN and the program will exit when the input is "
"haplotype-specific CN."
msgstr "如果总拷贝数超过程序允许的最大拷贝数：输入为总拷贝数时，会自动降到最大拷贝数；输入为 haplotype-specific 拷贝数时，程序会退出。"

#: ../../source/file-formats/index.md:27
msgid ""
"When the input copy numbers are relative with normal copy being 0 as those "
"output by CGHcall, please specify it with option \"--is_rcn 1\"."
msgstr "输入是相对拷贝数（像 CGHcall 的输出那样，正常拷贝记为 0）时，请指定 \"--is_rcn 1\"。"

#: ../../source/file-formats/index.md:29
msgid ""
"When the input copy numbers are haplotype-specific which have been scaled "
"relative to ploidy or not, please specify it with option \"--is_total 0 "
"--is_rcn 0\"."
msgstr "输入是 haplotype-specific 拷贝数（无论是否已按倍性缩放）时，请指定 \"--is_total 0 --is_rcn 0\"。"

#: ../../source/file-formats/index.md:31
msgid ""
"When the input copy numbers are in bins of fixed size, please specify it "
"with option \"--bin 0\" to use original data. By default \"--bin 1\" is used"
" to get segment-level data by merging consecutive bins with the same copy "
"number in a sample with change points aligned across all the samples."
msgstr ""
"输入拷贝数按固定大小的 bin 给出时，如需使用原始数据，请指定 \"--bin 0\"。默认使用 \"--bin "
"1\"：在所有样本的变化点对齐的前提下，合并样本中拷贝数相同的相邻 bin，得到 segment 级数据。"

#: ../../source/file-formats/index.md:33
msgid "Sample timing files"
msgstr "样本时间文件"

#: ../../source/file-formats/index.md:35
msgid ""
"`*-rel-times.txt` (optional input to `cnetml`/`cnetmcmc`; also written by "
"`cnets` as simulation output) records the sampling time of each tip node."
msgstr ""
"`*-rel-times.txt`（`cnetml`/`cnetmcmc` 的可选输入，`cnets` 也会作为模拟结果写出）记录每个 tip "
"节点的采样时间。"

#: ../../source/file-formats/index.md:39
msgid "Three space-separated columns, no header:"
msgstr "三列，空格分隔，无表头："

#: ../../source/file-formats/index.md:3 ../../source/file-formats/index.md:54
msgid "column"
msgstr "列"

#: ../../source/file-formats/index.md:3 ../../source/file-formats/index.md:54
msgid "meaning"
msgstr "含义"

#: ../../source/file-formats/index.md:3 ../../source/file-formats/index.md:291
msgid "`sample_ID`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/file-formats/index.md:3
msgid "ordered from 1 to n (number of patient samples)"
msgstr "从 1 编号到 n（患者样本数）"

#: ../../source/file-formats/index.md:3
msgid "`time`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/file-formats/index.md:3
msgid "time relative to the 1st sample, in years (float)"
msgstr "相对于第 1 个样本的时间，单位为年（浮点数）"

#: ../../source/file-formats/index.md:3
msgid "`age`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/file-formats/index.md:3
msgid "patient age at the time of sampling, in years (integer)"
msgstr "采样时的患者年龄，单位为年（整数）"

#: ../../source/file-formats/index.md:47
msgid ""
"Providing this file lets `cnetml`/`cnetmcmc` use tip-time information when "
"estimating divergence times and mutation rates (see `--constrained` in "
"`cnetml`, `--cons` in `cnetmcmc`, and `--tdiff` in `cnets` — see "
"[Configuration](../configuration/index.md))."
msgstr ""
"提供该文件后，`cnetml`/`cnetmcmc` 在估计分化时间和突变速率时可以利用 tip 的时间信息（见 `cnetml` 的 "
"`--constrained`、`cnetmcmc` 的 `--cons` 和 `cnets` 的 "
"`--tdiff`，以及[配置](../configuration/index.md)）。"

#: ../../source/file-formats/index.md:52
msgid "Tree formats"
msgstr "树文件格式"

#: ../../source/file-formats/index.md:55
msgid ""
"Filenames below were checked against `code/cnets.cpp`, `code/cnetml.cpp`, "
"and each tool's `run-*.sh` — not just taken from `README.md`, which gets "
"`cnetml`'s naming wrong (see the `cnetml` subsection)."
msgstr ""
"下面的文件名对照 `code/cnets.cpp`、`code/cnetml.cpp` 和各工具的 `run-*.sh` 核对过，不是照搬 "
"`README.md`；README 中 `cnetml` 的文件命名是错的（见 `cnetml` 小节）。"

#: ../../source/file-formats/index.md:60
msgid "`cnets` (tab-delimited `*-tree.txt`, NEWICK `*-tree.nex` / `*-tree-nmut.nex`)"
msgstr "`cnets`（制表符分隔的 `*-tree.txt`，NEWICK 格式的 `*-tree.nex` / `*-tree-nmut.nex`）"

#: ../../source/file-formats/index.md:62
msgid ""
"Filenames are hardcoded as `<prefix>-tree.txt`, `<prefix>-tree.nex`, "
"`<prefix>-tree-nmut.nex` — not user-configurable beyond the run's `prefix`."
msgstr ""
"文件名在代码中固定为 `<prefix>-tree.txt`、`<prefix>-tree.nex`、`<prefix>-tree-"
"nmut.nex`，除了运行时的 `prefix` 外不能自定义。"

#: ../../source/file-formats/index.md:66
msgid ""
"The tab-delimited file has one row per branch (edge) of the tree, columns "
"`start`, `end`, `length`, `eid`, `nmut`:"
msgstr "制表符分隔的文件每行对应树的一条分支（edge），列为 `start`、`end`、`length`、`eid`、`nmut`："

#: ../../source/file-formats/index.md:54
msgid "`start`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/file-formats/index.md:54
msgid "parent node ID"
msgstr "父节点 ID"

#: ../../source/file-formats/index.md:54
msgid "`end`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/file-formats/index.md:54
msgid "child node ID"
msgstr "子节点 ID"

#: ../../source/file-formats/index.md:54
msgid "`length`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/file-formats/index.md:54
msgid "branch length, in years"
msgstr "枝长，单位为年"

#: ../../source/file-formats/index.md:54
msgid "`eid`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/file-formats/index.md:54
msgid "edge ID (matches the `edge_ID` column in `*-mut.txt`)"
msgstr "分支 ID（对应 `*-mut.txt` 中的 `edge_ID` 列）"

#: ../../source/file-formats/index.md:54
msgid "`nmut`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/file-formats/index.md:54
msgid "number of mutations simulated on this branch"
msgstr "该分支上模拟的突变数"

#: ../../source/file-formats/index.md:78
msgid ""
"The top-level `README.md` states node IDs run 0..n-1 for samples, n for the "
"normal sample, n+1 for the root, and n+2..2n+1 for internal nodes. The "
"example output in `example/sim-data-1-tree.txt` instead uses 1-based sample "
"IDs (1..4, with 5 as root). Please confirm which convention the current code"
" actually uses before relying on this."
msgstr ""
"顶层 `README.md` 说节点 ID 为：样本 0..n-1，正常样本 n，根 n+1，内部节点 n+2..2n+1。但 `example"
"/sim-data-1-tree.txt` 中的示例输出用的是从 1 开始的样本 ID（1..4，根为 5）。使用前请确认当前代码实际采用哪种约定。"

#: ../../source/file-formats/index.md:85
msgid "The two NEWICK files are standard NEXUS-wrapped NEWICK, one tree per file:"
msgstr "两个 NEWICK 文件是标准的、包在 NEXUS 格式里的 NEWICK，每个文件一棵树："

#: ../../source/file-formats/index.md:88
msgid "`*-tree.nex`: branch length = calendar time (years)"
msgstr "`*-tree.nex`：枝长 = 日历时间（年）"

#: ../../source/file-formats/index.md:89
msgid "`*-tree-nmut.nex`: branch length = expected number of CNAs per site"
msgstr "`*-tree-nmut.nex`：枝长 = 每个 site 的期望 CNA 数"

#: ../../source/file-formats/index.md:91
msgid "Example (from `example/sim-data-1-tree.nex`):"
msgstr "示例（来自 `example/sim-data-1-tree.nex`）："

#: ../../source/file-formats/index.md:100
msgid "`cnetml` (`<ofile>`, `<ofile>.nex`, `<ofile>.nmut.nex`)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/file-formats/index.md:103
msgid ""
"`README.md` (and earlier versions of the `cnetml` User guide page) describe "
"these as `*-tree.txt` / `*-tree.nex` / `*-tree.nmut.nex`. That's wrong: "
"`code/cnetml.cpp` has no hardcoded `-tree` suffix anywhere."
msgstr ""
"`README.md`（以及 `cnetml` 使用指南页面的早期版本）把这些文件写成 `*-tree.txt` / `*-tree.nex` / "
"`*-tree.nmut.nex`，这是错的：`code/cnetml.cpp` 中没有任何固定的 `-tree` 后缀。"

#: ../../source/file-formats/index.md:108
msgid ""
"`cnetml` writes its reconstructed tree to whatever file you pass with "
"`-o`/`--ofile` (C++ default: `maxL-tree.txt`), then appends fixed extensions"
" for the other outputs. `run-cnetml.sh` sets `--ofile` to "
"`MaxL-<suffix>.txt`, so in practice you'll see e.g. `MaxL-sim1.txt`, `MaxL-"
"sim1.txt.nex`, `MaxL-sim1.txt.nmut.nex` — not files with `-tree` in the name"
" at all, unless you choose an `--ofile` value that includes it."
msgstr ""
"`cnetml` 把重建的树写到用 `-o`/`--ofile` 指定的文件（C++ 默认值：`maxL-"
"tree.txt`），其他输出在此基础上加固定扩展名。`run-cnetml.sh` 把 `--ofile` 设为 "
"`MaxL-<suffix>.txt`，所以实际看到的是 `MaxL-sim1.txt`、`MaxL-sim1.txt.nex`、`MaxL-"
"sim1.txt.nmut.nex` 这样的文件名；除非 `--ofile` 的值本身含 `-tree`，否则文件名中不会出现 `-tree`。"

#: ../../source/file-formats/index.md:116
msgid ""
"`<ofile>`: the tree in the same tab-delimited format as `cnets` (calendar-"
"time branch lengths)"
msgstr "`<ofile>`：与 `cnets` 相同的制表符分隔格式的树（枝长为日历时间）"

#: ../../source/file-formats/index.md:118
msgid "`<ofile>.nex`: NEWICK, calendar-time branch lengths"
msgstr "`<ofile>.nex`：NEWICK，枝长为日历时间"

#: ../../source/file-formats/index.md:119
msgid "`<ofile>.nmut.nex`: NEWICK, branch length = number of mutations"
msgstr "`<ofile>.nmut.nex`：NEWICK，枝长 = 突变数"

#: ../../source/file-formats/index.md:121
msgid "`cnetml` run reports (`<ofile>.summary.txt`, `<ofile>.edge_rates.txt`)"
msgstr "`cnetml` 运行报告（`<ofile>.summary.txt`、`<ofile>.edge_rates.txt`）"

#: ../../source/file-formats/index.md:123
msgid "Written alongside the tree files above; not mentioned in `README.md` at all."
msgstr "与上面的树文件一起写出；`README.md` 中完全没有提到。"

#: ../../source/file-formats/index.md:126
msgid "`<ofile>.summary.txt`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/file-formats/index.md:127
msgid ""
"`key<TAB>value` lines: `mode`, `model`, `bsr_mode`, `cn_type`, "
"`constrained`, `estmu`, `estimate_bsr0_first`, `rlc_criterion` (for "
"`bsr_mode 3`), `raw_logL`, `penalized_score`, `K_shift_edges`, `shift_eids`,"
" per-event-type reference mutation rates (`dup_rate_reference`, ...), "
"length-weighted effective rates (`dup_rate_final_global_weighted`, ...), "
"`n_edges`, `n_leaves`."
msgstr ""
"每行为 "
"`key<TAB>value`：`mode`、`model`、`bsr_mode`、`cn_type`、`constrained`、`estmu`、`estimate_bsr0_first`、`rlc_criterion`（`bsr_mode"
" 3` "
"时）、`raw_logL`、`penalized_score`、`K_shift_edges`、`shift_eids`、各事件类型的参考突变速率（`dup_rate_reference`"
" 等）、按枝长加权的有效速率（`dup_rate_final_global_weighted` 等）、`n_edges`、`n_leaves`。"

#: ../../source/file-formats/index.md:134
msgid "`<ofile>.edge_rates.txt`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/file-formats/index.md:135
msgid ""
"One row per edge. Columns: `eid`, `start`, `end`, `length`, `nmut_expected`,"
" `dup_expected`, `del_expected`, `chr_gain_expected`, `chr_loss_expected`, "
"`wgd_expected`, `nmut_observed`, `dup_observed`, `del_observed`, "
"`chr_gain_observed`, `chr_loss_observed`, `wgd_observed`, `dup_rate`, "
"`del_rate`, `chr_gain_rate`, `chr_loss_rate`, `wgd_rate`, `total_rate`, "
"`m_shared`, `m_dup`, `m_del`, `m_chr_gain`, `m_chr_loss`, `m_wgd`, "
"`is_shift_edge`, `local_clock_id`. The last several columns are only "
"meaningful with `bsr_mode > 0` (`NA` otherwise)."
msgstr ""
"每条分支一行。列：`eid`、`start`、`end`、`length`、`nmut_expected`、`dup_expected`、`del_expected`、`chr_gain_expected`、`chr_loss_expected`、`wgd_expected`、`nmut_observed`、`dup_observed`、`del_observed`、`chr_gain_observed`、`chr_loss_observed`、`wgd_observed`、`dup_rate`、`del_rate`、`chr_gain_rate`、`chr_loss_rate`、`wgd_rate`、`total_rate`、`m_shared`、`m_dup`、`m_del`、`m_chr_gain`、`m_chr_loss`、`m_wgd`、`is_shift_edge`、`local_clock_id`。最后几列只在"
" `bsr_mode > 0` 时有意义（否则为 `NA`）。"

#: ../../source/file-formats/index.md:145
msgid "MCMC sampled trees (`*.t`)"
msgstr "MCMC 采样得到的树（`*.t`）"

#: ../../source/file-formats/index.md:147
msgid ""
"Written by `cnetmcmc` in a format similar to MrBayes output — a block of "
"trees sampled during the chain. Analyze with "
"[TreeAnnotator](https://beast.community/treeannotator) to get a maximum-"
"clade-credibility summary tree."
msgstr ""
"由 `cnetmcmc` 写出，格式类似 MrBayes 的输出，是链运行过程中采样得到的一组树。用 "
"[TreeAnnotator](https://beast.community/treeannotator) 分析，得到最大分支可信度汇总树。"

#: ../../source/file-formats/index.md:152
msgid "Mutation outputs"
msgstr "突变输出"

#: ../../source/file-formats/index.md:154
msgid "Simulated mutation list (`*-mut.txt`, from `cnets`)"
msgstr "模拟的突变列表（`*-mut.txt`，来自 `cnets`）"

#: ../../source/file-formats/index.md:156
msgid ""
"One row per simulated mutation event. Columns, in the order the code writes "
"them (`code/cnets.cpp`, the `*-mut.txt` writer): `sample_ID`, `edge_ID`, "
"`muttype_ID`, `mut_btime`, `mut_etime`, `chr_haplotype`, `chr`, `seg_ID`."
msgstr ""
"每个模拟的突变事件一行。列按代码写出的顺序（`code/cnets.cpp` 中写 `*-mut.txt` "
"的部分）为：`sample_ID`、`edge_ID`、`muttype_ID`、`mut_btime`、`mut_etime`、`chr_haplotype`、`chr`、`seg_ID`。"

#: ../../source/file-formats/index.md:161
msgid ""
"`edge_ID` matches the `eid` column in `*-tree.txt` (see [Tree formats"
"](#tree-formats)), so mutations can be mapped onto branches."
msgstr "`edge_ID` 对应 `*-tree.txt` 中的 `eid` 列（见[树文件格式](#tree-formats)），因此可以把突变定位到分支上。"

#: ../../source/file-formats/index.md:164
msgid "For a chromosome gain/loss event, `seg_ID` is `-1`."
msgstr "染色体 gain/loss 事件的 `seg_ID` 为 `-1`。"

#: ../../source/file-formats/index.md:165
msgid "For a whole-genome-doubling event, `chr` is `0` and `seg_ID` is `-1`."
msgstr "全基因组加倍事件的 `chr` 为 `0`，`seg_ID` 为 `-1`。"

#: ../../source/file-formats/index.md:168
msgid ""
"`muttype_ID` isn't enumerated anywhere in the code near the writer; treat "
"its values as opaque until confirmed (likely the same event-type IDs as "
"`--cn_type`/`r1`-`r5`)."
msgstr ""
"写出这一列的代码附近没有列出 `muttype_ID` 的取值含义；确认之前请不要依赖其具体取值（很可能与 `--cn_type`/`r1`-`r5` "
"的事件类型 ID 相同）。"

#: ../../source/file-formats/index.md:172
msgid ""
"`chr_haplotype` and `chr` **are** resolvable, and don't mean quite what the "
"column names suggest. Internally each chromosome is stored twice — once per "
"haplotype copy — as a single 0-based index 0..43 (`genome.hpp`/`genome.cpp`:"
" `hap_index = chromosome(0..21) + 22 * haplotype(0 or 1)`, since `NUM_CHR = "
"22`, autosomes only). The mutation struct keeps only this combined index "
"(`mutation.chr` — there's no separate haplotype field). The writer then "
"outputs:"
msgstr ""
"`chr_haplotype` 和 `chr` **可以**解析出来，但含义和列名不完全一样。程序内部每条染色体按两个 haplotype "
"各存一份，用一个从 0 开始的索引 0..43 表示（`genome.hpp`/`genome.cpp`：`hap_index = "
"chromosome(0..21) + 22 * haplotype(0 or 1)`，因为 `NUM_CHR = "
"22`，只考虑常染色体）。突变结构体只保存这个合并索引（`mutation.chr`，没有单独的 haplotype 字段）。写出时："

#: ../../source/file-formats/index.md:180
msgid ""
"`chr_haplotype` = `mutation.chr + 1` (range 1..44) — chromosome *and* "
"haplotype together, not haplotype alone despite the column name."
msgstr ""
"`chr_haplotype` = `mutation.chr + 1`（范围 1..44）：同时编码染色体*和* "
"haplotype，而不是列名所说的只有 haplotype。"

#: ../../source/file-formats/index.md:182
msgid ""
"`chr` = `(mutation.chr + 1) % 22` — recovers the 1-based chromosome number, "
"**except** chromosome 22 itself wraps to `0` (there's no explicit re-mapping"
" back to 22)."
msgstr ""
"`chr` = `(mutation.chr + 1) % 22`：得到从 1 开始的染色体编号，**但** 22 号染色体本身会变成 "
"`0`（代码没有把它映射回 22）。"

#: ../../source/file-formats/index.md:186
msgid ""
"To recover haplotype separately: `mutation.chr >= 22` (i.e. `chr_haplotype >"
" 22`) is the second haplotype copy."
msgstr "要单独得到 haplotype：`mutation.chr >= 22`（即 `chr_haplotype > 22`）表示第二个 haplotype。"

#: ../../source/file-formats/index.md:190
msgid "Per-branch mutation counts (`*-info.txt`, from `cnets`)"
msgstr "各分支突变数（`*-info.txt`，来自 `cnets`）"

#: ../../source/file-formats/index.md:192
msgid ""
"The first two lines record the seeds that produced the data set: `SEED: "
"<number>`, and `TREE SEED: <number>` or `TREE SEED: same stream as SEED` "
"when `--tree_seed` was not given. Then the time of each node and the total "
"number of mutations simulated on each branch, grouped by the lineages of tip"
" nodes."
msgstr ""
"前两行记录生成该数据集所用的随机种子：`SEED: <number>`，以及 `TREE SEED: <number>`（未指定 "
"`--tree_seed` 时为 `TREE SEED: same stream as SEED`）。接下来是各节点的时间和各分支上模拟的突变总数，按 "
"tip 节点的谱系分组。"

#: ../../source/file-formats/index.md:198
msgid "Simulation edge-rate table (`*-edge_rates.txt`, from `cnets`)"
msgstr "模拟的分支速率表（`*-edge_rates.txt`，来自 `cnets`）"

#: ../../source/file-formats/index.md:200
msgid ""
"Same column layout as `cnetml`'s [`<ofile>.edge_rates.txt`](#tree-formats) —"
" the true, simulation-time per-branch rates and (for `bsr_mode > 0`) which "
"branches got a rate shift, rather than `cnetml`'s reconstructed estimates. "
"Not mentioned in `README.md`."
msgstr ""
"列的排列与 `cnetml` 的 [`<ofile>.edge_rates.txt`](#tree-formats) "
"相同，但记录的是模拟时各分支的真实速率，以及（`bsr_mode > 0` 时）哪些分支发生了速率变化，而不是 `cnetml` "
"重建的估计值。`README.md` 中没有提到。"

#: ../../source/file-formats/index.md:206
msgid "Ancestral-state reconstruction outputs (`cnetml` mode 4)"
msgstr "祖先状态重建输出（`cnetml` mode 4）"

#: ../../source/file-formats/index.md:208
msgid "Named `<ofile>.<suffix>`, same `<ofile>` as in [Tree formats](#tree-formats)."
msgstr "文件名为 `<ofile>.<suffix>`，`<ofile>` 与[树文件格式](#tree-formats)中相同。"

#: ../../source/file-formats/index.md:211
msgid "For models 0-2:"
msgstr "Model 0-2："

#: ../../source/file-formats/index.md:167
msgid "file"
msgstr "文件"

#: ../../source/file-formats/index.md:167
msgid "contents"
msgstr "内容"

#: ../../source/file-formats/index.md:167
msgid "`<ofile>.mrca.cn`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/file-formats/index.md:167
msgid ""
"Reconstructed copy numbers for the most recent common ancestor of all tumour"
" samples. `node_ID chr_ID site_ID CN` (total) or `node_ID chr_ID site_ID cnA"
" cnB` (haplotype-specific)."
msgstr ""
"所有肿瘤样本最近共同祖先的重建拷贝数。`node_ID chr_ID site_ID CN`（总拷贝数）或 `node_ID chr_ID "
"site_ID cnA cnB`（haplotype-specific）。"

#: ../../source/file-formats/index.md:167
msgid "`<ofile>.joint.cn`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/file-formats/index.md:167
msgid "Same, for all internal nodes."
msgstr "同上，针对所有内部节点。"

#: ../../source/file-formats/index.md:167
msgid "`<ofile>.mrca.state`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/file-formats/index.md:167
msgid ""
"Posterior probability of each possible copy-number state, for each variant "
"site (a site with at least one atypical copy number across samples), at the "
"MRCA node: `node_ID site_ID probability_stateID`."
msgstr ""
"MRCA 节点上，每个变异 site（至少在一个样本中拷贝数异常的 site）每种可能拷贝数状态的后验概率：`node_ID site_ID "
"probability_stateID`。"

#: ../../source/file-formats/index.md:167
msgid "`<ofile>.joint.state`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/file-formats/index.md:167
msgid ""
"Possible copy-number state at each variant site, for all internal nodes: "
"`node_ID site_ID cn_stateID`."
msgstr "所有内部节点上，每个变异 site 的拷贝数状态：`node_ID site_ID cn_stateID`。"

#: ../../source/file-formats/index.md:220
msgid ""
"In `<ofile>.mrca.state`/`<ofile>.joint.state`, `site_ID` is written as "
"`chromosomeID_siteID`, and the state ID matches the state index of the "
"Markov-model rate matrix used for reconstruction."
msgstr ""
"在 `<ofile>.mrca.state`/`<ofile>.joint.state` 中，`site_ID` 写成 "
"`chromosomeID_siteID`，状态 ID 对应重建所用 Markov 模型速率矩阵的状态索引。"

#: ../../source/file-formats/index.md:167
msgid ""
"Reconstructed copy number of every internal node at every site, and the "
"change of each chain behind it."
msgstr "所有内部节点在每个 site 的重建拷贝数，以及构成它的每条链的变化。"

#: ../../source/file-formats/index.md:167
msgid "Most likely copy number of the MRCA at every site, as above plus `prob`."
msgstr "MRCA 在每个 site 最可能的拷贝数，列同上，另加 `prob`。"

#: ../../source/file-formats/index.md:167
msgid ""
"State index of each chain for every internal node: `node site wgd_state "
"chr_state site_state`."
msgstr "所有内部节点上每条链的状态索引：`node site wgd_state chr_state site_state`。"

#: ../../source/file-formats/index.md:167
msgid "`<ofile>.mrca.seg.state`"
msgstr "`<ofile>.mrca.seg.state`"

#: ../../source/file-formats/index.md:167
msgid "Posterior probability of each site-level state at the MRCA, per site."
msgstr "MRCA 上每个 site 级状态的后验概率，每个 site 一行。"

#: ../../source/file-formats/index.md:167
msgid "`<ofile>.mrca.chr.state`"
msgstr "`<ofile>.mrca.chr.state`"

#: ../../source/file-formats/index.md:167
msgid "Same, chromosome-level, per chromosome."
msgstr "同上，染色体级，每条染色体一行。"

#: ../../source/file-formats/index.md:167
msgid "`<ofile>.mrca.wgd.state`"
msgstr "`<ofile>.mrca.wgd.state`"

#: ../../source/file-formats/index.md:167
msgid "Posterior probability of 0, 1, … WGDs at the MRCA."
msgstr "MRCA 上发生 0、1、… 次 WGD 的后验概率。"

#: ../../source/file-formats/index.md:224
msgid ""
"For model 3 (independent Markov chains), a copy number is built from "
"three chains: whole-genome doublings (WGD), chromosome-level changes and "
"site-level changes. Each file is tab-separated."
msgstr ""
"Model 3（independent Markov chains）中，一个拷贝数由三条链组成：全基因组加倍（WGD）、染色体级变化和 site "
"级变化。各文件均以制表符分隔。"

#: ../../source/file-formats/index.md:237
msgid ""
"The `.cn` files start with a header line beginning with `#`, so a reader "
"that skips comment lines sees the same leading columns as for models 0-2:"
msgstr "`.cn` 文件第一行是以 `#` 开头的表头，因此跳过注释行读取时，前几列与 model 0-2 相同："

#: ../../source/file-formats/index.md:246
msgid ""
"`num_wgd` is the number of WGDs; each one doubles the baseline of one "
"copy per haplotype. `chr_change` and `site_change` are the copies gained "
"(positive) or lost (negative) at chromosome and site level, on top of "
"that baseline. A copy number is the baseline plus both changes, e.g. `cn "
"3 num_wgd 0 chr_change 1 site_change 0`. With total copy numbers the "
"changes are summed over the two haplotypes."
msgstr ""
"`num_wgd` 是 WGD 次数，每次使每条单倍型一份的基础拷贝数加倍。`chr_change` 和 `site_change` "
"是在该基础上，染色体级和 site 级增加（正数）或减少（负数）的拷贝数。拷贝数等于基础加上两层变化，例如 `cn 3 num_wgd 0 "
"chr_change 1 site_change 0`。总拷贝数时，变化为两条单倍型之和。"

#: ../../source/file-formats/index.md:252
msgid ""
"The chains are independent, so their changes can take one haplotype below"
" zero (e.g. a chromosome-level and a site-level loss on the same "
"haplotype with one copy). Each haplotype's copy number is floored at 0. "
"With total copy numbers, where the haplotypes are not shown, such a line "
"has `cn` larger than the baseline plus both changes, e.g. `cn 1 num_wgd 0"
" chr_change -1 site_change -1`."
msgstr ""
"三条链相互独立，其变化可能使某条单倍型低于 0（例如只有一份拷贝的同一条单倍型上，染色体级和 site 级各减少一份）。每条单倍型的拷贝数最低为 "
"0。总拷贝数时不显示单倍型，这样的行中 `cn` 会大于基础加上两层变化，例如 `cn 1 num_wgd 0 chr_change -1 "
"site_change -1`。"

#: ../../source/file-formats/index.md:258
msgid ""
"A chain that is not modelled (its maximum change is 0, or the data have "
"no events of that type) is reported as no change."
msgstr "未建模的链（最大变化为 0，或数据中没有该类事件）记为没有变化。"

#: ../../source/file-formats/index.md:260
msgid ""
"`prob` (`.mrca.cn` only) is the posterior probability of the reported "
"copy number, summed over every combination of chain states giving it. The"
" chains are independent, so a combination has the product of the chain "
"probabilities. Several combinations can give the same copy number, so the"
" reported copy number is not always the one built from each chain's most "
"likely state; the chain changes on the line are the most likely "
"combination giving it."
msgstr ""
"`prob`（仅 "
"`.mrca.cn`）是所给拷贝数的后验概率，为所有得到该拷贝数的链状态组合之和。三条链相互独立，一个组合的概率是各链概率的乘积。多种组合可得到同一拷贝数，因此所给拷贝数不一定由各链最可能的状态组成；该行中各链的变化是得到该拷贝数的最可能组合。"

#: ../../source/file-formats/index.md:267
msgid ""
"In the `.mrca.*.state` files, `probability_k` is the probability of state"
" `k`: for total copy numbers, the copy number `k` from that chain alone "
"(`k = 2` is no change); for haplotype-specific copy numbers, the index of"
" the change pair in the chain's rate matrix. The probabilities include "
"the trunk edge from the normal root to the MRCA. The `.seg`/`.chr`/`.wgd`"
" files are written only for chains with a non-zero state space."
msgstr ""
"在 `.mrca.*.state` 文件中，`probability_k` 是状态 `k` 的概率：总拷贝数时，`k` "
"是仅由该链得到的拷贝数（`k = 2` 表示没有变化）；haplotype-specific 时，`k` "
"是变化对在该链速率矩阵中的索引。概率包含从正常根节点到 MRCA 的主干边。`.seg`/`.chr`/`.wgd` "
"文件只在该链状态空间维度不为零时写出。"

#: ../../source/file-formats/index.md:274
msgid ""
"`.joint.state` writes each distinct pattern of observed copy numbers "
"once, at its first site; `.joint.cn` has every site."
msgstr "`.joint.state` 中每种不同的观测拷贝数模式只写一次，位于其第一个 site；`.joint.cn` 包含全部 site。"

#: ../../source/file-formats/index.md:277
msgid ""
"None of this is in `README.md`; model 3 is still described there as \"in "
"development, at test branch\"."
msgstr "这些在 `README.md` 中都没有；那里仍把 model 3 描述为\"开发中，在 test 分支\"。"

#: ../../source/file-formats/index.md:236
msgid "MCMC configuration and trace files"
msgstr "MCMC 配置文件和 trace 文件"

#: ../../source/file-formats/index.md:238
msgid "Config file (`config/cnet_mcmc.cfg`)"
msgstr "配置文件（`config/cnet_mcmc.cfg`）"

#: ../../source/file-formats/index.md:240
msgid ""
"Plain-text `key=value` pairs, one per line, `#` for comments and blank lines"
" allowed. Each key is a `cnetmcmc` long option name without the leading "
"`--`; an unknown key is an error. A value given on the command line "
"overrides the same key in the file. Passed to `cnetmcmc` with "
"`--config_file` (see `bin/run-cnetmcmc.sh`). Grouped in the file by purpose:"
msgstr ""
"纯文本的 `key=value`，每行一个，`#` 开头为注释，允许空行。每个 key 是 `cnetmcmc` 的长参数名去掉开头的 `--`；未知的"
" key 会报错。命令行上给出的值优先于文件中的同名 key。用 `--config_file` 传给 `cnetmcmc`（见 `bin/run-"
"cnetmcmc.sh`）。文件中按用途分组："

#: ../../source/file-formats/index.md:269
msgid ""
"...followed by blocks for the true/initial mutation rates, per-rate-type "
"prior/proposal parameters (`sigma_l*` for the log-normal prior, `sigma_*` "
"for the proposal, one pair per event type), tree-height parameters, and "
"branch-length parameters. See `config/cnet_mcmc.cfg` for the full set with "
"inline comments, and [`cnetmcmc` options](../user-guide/cnetmcmc.md#options)"
" for what each group controls."
msgstr ""
"……后面是真实/初始突变速率、各类速率的先验/proposal 参数（每种事件类型一对：`sigma_l*` 用于 lognormal "
"先验，`sigma_*` 用于 proposal）、树高参数和枝长参数。完整参数及行内注释见 "
"`config/cnet_mcmc.cfg`，各组参数的作用见 [`cnetmcmc` 参数](../user-"
"guide/cnetmcmc.md#options)。"

#: ../../source/file-formats/index.md:277
msgid "Trace files (output)"
msgstr "Trace 文件（输出）"

#: ../../source/file-formats/index.md:279
msgid "MrBayes-compatible:"
msgstr "与 MrBayes 兼容："

#: ../../source/file-formats/index.md:281
msgid "`*.p`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/file-formats/index.md:282
msgid ""
"Parameter traces. Check convergence with "
"[Tracer](https://beast.community/tracer) or `util/check_convergence.R` (uses"
" [RWTY](https://github.com/danlwarren/RWTY))."
msgstr ""
"参数 trace。用 [Tracer](https://beast.community/tracer) 或 "
"`util/check_convergence.R`（基于 "
"[RWTY](https://github.com/danlwarren/RWTY)）检查收敛。"

#: ../../source/file-formats/index.md:286
msgid "`*.t`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/file-formats/index.md:287
msgid "Sampled trees — see [Tree formats](#tree-formats)."
msgstr "采样得到的树，见[树文件格式](#tree-formats)。"

#: ../../source/file-formats/index.md:289
msgid "Identifiers and conventions"
msgstr "标识符与约定"

#: ../../source/file-formats/index.md:292
msgid ""
"1-based, ordered from 1 to n (the number of patient samples). Used "
"consistently in `*-cn.txt.gz`/`*-haplotype-cn.txt.gz` and `*-rel-times.txt`."
" The normal sample is not counted in n and is identified separately (see the"
" tree-node-ID warning under [Tree formats](#tree-formats) — the exact "
"convention needs confirming)."
msgstr ""
"从 1 开始，从 1 编号到 n（患者样本数）。在 `*-cn.txt.gz`/`*-haplotype-cn.txt.gz` 和 `*-rel-"
"times.txt` 中一致使用。正常样本不计入 n，单独标识（见[树文件格式](#tree-formats)中关于树节点 ID "
"的提醒，具体约定有待确认）。"

#: ../../source/file-formats/index.md:299
msgid "`chr_ID`, `site_ID`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/file-formats/index.md:300
msgid ""
"Both 1-based. Together they identify a unique site on the genome of a "
"sample. `site_ID` can be numbered either consecutively across the whole "
"genome, or consecutively within each chromosome — the file itself doesn't "
"say which, so the two ends of a pipeline (e.g. a preprocessing script and "
"`cnetml`) must agree on the convention out of band."
msgstr ""
"都从 1 开始，两者共同标识样本基因组上唯一的 site。`site_ID` "
"可以在全基因组范围内连续编号，也可以在每条染色体内连续编号；文件本身不说明是哪一种，所以流程两端（例如预处理脚本和 `cnetml`）需要另外约定好。"

#: ../../source/file-formats/index.md:307
msgid "`edge_ID` / `eid`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/file-formats/index.md:308
msgid ""
"1-based, shared between `*-tree.txt` and `*-mut.txt` to map mutations onto "
"tree branches."
msgstr "从 1 开始，`*-tree.txt` 和 `*-mut.txt` 共用，用于把突变定位到树的分支上。"

#: ../../source/file-formats/index.md:311
msgid "0- vs 1-based coordinates"
msgstr "从 0 还是从 1 开始编号"

#: ../../source/file-formats/index.md:312
msgid ""
"Input files (`*-cn.txt.gz`, `*-rel-times.txt`) are consistently 1-based. "
"Tree node IDs are where the documentation and an actual example output "
"disagree — see the warning under [Tree formats](#tree-formats)."
msgstr ""
"输入文件（`*-cn.txt.gz`、`*-rel-times.txt`）一律从 1 开始。树节点 ID "
"是文档和实际示例输出不一致的地方，见[树文件格式](#tree-formats)中的提醒。"

#: ../../source/file-formats/index.md:206
msgid ""
"Either table can be given to `cnetml --mode 4 -d 3 --edge_rate_file` to "
"reconstruct ancestral states with per-branch rates. cnetml reads only the"
" `start`, `end`, `length` and five `*_rate` columns. See [Ancestral "
"states with branch-specific rates](../user-guide/cnetml.md#ancestral-"
"states-with-branch-specific-rates)."
msgstr ""
"这两种表都可以作为 `cnetml --mode 4 -d 3 --edge_rate_file` "
"的输入，用每条分支的速率重建祖先状态。cnetml 只读取 `start`、`end`、`length` 和五个 `*_rate` "
"列。见[分支特异速率下的祖先状态](../user-guide/cnetml.md#ancestral-states-with-branch-"
"specific-rates)。"
